# Gallery artworks

The eight works in this directory are original, code-generated abstract prints
created for this demo by Esteban Vizcaino in 2026. They are not photographs and
do not depict people.

They are released under the **Creative Commons Attribution 4.0 International**
license (CC BY 4.0): <https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/>.

You may share and adapt them, including commercially, as long as you give
appropriate credit. Suggested attribution:

> "Field Notes" series, Esteban Vizcaino, 2026, CC BY 4.0.

The generator is included at `scripts/generate_gallery.py`, so the works can be
reproduced from source. The metadata in `works.json` is part of the same
release.
